; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\">관심 있는 대학원생분들께서 참여하실 수 있도록 적극적인 관심을 부탁드립니다.</span></span></p></span><p><br></p><p><img style=\"border: 0px currentColor; border-image: none; vertical-align: middle;\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.ultari.org/kofst/html/images/mail/2021_YPF_1.jpg\" usemap=\"#Map\"></p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"https://answer.moaform.com/answers/R8dzxB\">https://answer.moaform.com/answers/R8dzxB</a></p><p><br></p><p><span></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
